      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">In 2024, Total Reported Revenues of 75.4 million includes $29.065 MM attributable to Leased Transportation capacity that is not part of Overthrust&#8217;s system pursuant to 119 FERC &#182; 61,069, at P 40 (2007). In addition, approximately 21% of Overthrust&#8217;s overall costs are allocable to the Leased Transportation capacity.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
