        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">In 2025, Total Reported Operating Revenues of $76.7 million includes $29.065 MM attributable to Leased Transportation capacity that is not part of Overthrust&#8217;s system pursuant to 119 FERC &#182; 61,069, at P 40 (2007).</span>
